    "UIName": "New Dawn",
    "Id": "chassisdef_new_dawn_ND-TWS",
    "Name": "New Dawn",
    "Details": "A Custom Built New Dawn, for a Mercenary outfit. The Entire Mech has been Stripped and Reassembled, built to Heat up the Enemies. Increased Engine Size and a Supercharger Lead to a Very Fast Assault Mech, which befits it Close Range weaponry. A Full Clan ECM suite, while rare, Provide Excellent EWAR capabilities. A Full Rework of the Cockpit has also lead to the Mech not Overheating as badly as others, so it can Brawl longer than its brothers. 'Not For Commercial Sale'  is printed on the Mech, but you cannot see it with the naked Eye.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.17</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_newdawn"
  },
